### 1) List sample payloads
GET http://localhost:8093/api/demo/samples

### 2) Seed example messages (creates multiple stored records)
POST http://localhost:8093/api/demo/seed
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 3) Create a support message (contains PII)
POST http://localhost:8093/api/support/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-1001",
  "channel": "webchat",
  "subject": "Billing update request",
  "message": "Hi, my email is sara.ahmed@example.com and my phone is +1 (555) 123-4567. Please update my subscription."
}

### 4) Create a support message (no PII)
POST http://localhost:8093/api/support/messages
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customerId": "cust-1002",
  "channel": "email",
  "subject": "Feature question",
  "message": "Do you support downgrading from Pro to Starter mid-cycle?"
}

### 5) List stored messages (only redacted content is stored)
GET http://localhost:8093/api/support/messages

### 6) Read one message by id
GET http://localhost:8093/api/support/messages/1
